Issue Title: [BUG] ToolUsage not using same I18N as Agent

Description:
### Description

The ToolUsage class defaults to using I18N() and has no way to update it. It should use the same I18N as the agent so that custom prompt_file's work properly.

### Steps to Reproduce

1. Make a new prompt file (like translation/en.json) and edit the `tool_usage_exception` message.
